<title>MEXICO: Mexico's 28-day TIIE internbank rises.</title>
<headline>Mexico's 28-day TIIE internbank rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank equilibrium interest rate (TIIE) for June 30 was calculated at 23.80 percent, Bank of Mexico sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The rate showed an increase of 0.54 basis points over the rate for Friday 27 of 23.26 percent. Monday's level will be published in the government's Official Gazette.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7902))</p>
